{
  "title": "Synchronisation — Race Condition",
  "description": "Two processes each increment a shared-memory counter ten times with no lock. Preemption between the read and the write loses updates: the final value is less than 20. Add LOCK m / UNLOCK m around the read-modify-write to fix it.",
